{"synopsis":"Kota yang ramai dan masyarakat yang damai langsung hancur oleh kiamat yang tiba-tiba. Monster yang tercemar yang tak terhitung jumlahnya membanjiri dunia, zona terlarang muncul, menghubungkan dunia kiamat, yang menyebabkan kematian miliaran orang dan lautan darah. Selama waktu ini, Chen Chu yang tumbuh diam-diam, sebanding dengan dewa, melangkah maju. Di belakangnya mengikuti raksasa hitam yang menjulang tinggi, setinggi sepuluh ribu meter, menyerupai Godzilla tetapi bahkan lebih menakutkan dan besar.","alternative_title":"Demon God of Ominous Behemoth I Transformed into a Demon God and Became a World-Destroying Beast! 我化身魔神，成为灭世巨兽！","author":"Meeting at the Summit of Jade Peaks, Runaway Ants","artist":"有马文化","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ed551628-c9e2-4a64-94a1-e1e244b1e152","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"a405cb15-d144-4877-a5b9-cf46a6d82c90","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21"},{"chapter_id":"420c25a9-06f1-4e84-bd87-d723766cb2d8","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"1bf1a854-570d-4e03-b6ba-922195ae4ad3","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18"},{"chapter_id":"11b1d047-49c7-4435-95f4-7ac58b56434b","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"f1b9dea9-0f37-4bfe-948c-49d3390b9728","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"","date":"2026-05-31","released":"2026-05-31"},{"chapter_id":"b4aa0557-61a8-4de7-a29b-005694fbcff9","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2026-05-19","released":"2026-05-19"},{"chapter_id":"e057abbd-17a8-4284-ad27-e7946832f843","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"","date":"2026-05-01","released":"2026-05-01"},{"chapter_id":"79b28a52-ad03-4096-b04a-9cb9f4d669af","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"","date":"2026-04-30","released":"2026-04-30"},{"chapter_id":